{"version":1,"content":"<p>知情人士透露，五角大樓正和通用汽車以及其他製造企業展開初步談判，希望藉助它們實現軍用無人機的大規模生產。五角大樓正在與通用汽車、其他製造企業洽談，希望大規模生產無人機。這是美軍最新舉措：動員汽車行業龐大的裝配生產線，用來增產關鍵彈藥與軍事裝備。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587850.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T15:24:02.831001+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T15:11:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T15:17:14.923105+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:17:14.923105+00:00","content_hash":"93813c2bed97150b9d39b124b6fdfb3ba08277f61f17cdca1cbeb15a6eceb53f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}